Prepare a defensive device that stores an electrical charge for 8 turns.

If your life falls below 0 while the AED is active it will activate to shock you back into life, negating the triggering attack, restoring [313, 422, 506, 577, 641 (TL1-5; STEAMPOWER 100)] life and dealing [197, 266, 318, 363, 403 (TL1-5; STEAMPOWER 100)] lightning damage in radius [2, 3, 4, 4, 5 (TL1-5)] that dazes affected enemies for 3 turns.

If the AED does not activate, the cooldown is reduced by 15 turns.

The healing and damage will increase with your Steampower.
